  "description": "PANORAMA360 is the highest observation deck in Europe, located on the 89th floor of the Federation Tower of Moscow-City. PANORAMA360 is a full member of the World Federation of Great Towers. There are many entertainment areas on the observation deck. For example, the highest ice-cream and chocolate factories in the world and amazing 360° view of Moscow. There are also a 360 restaurant, a mini-cinema and a gift shop.",
